    "structure_location": "D03/BiF3 topology, Fm-3m, 16 atoms/cell. Reference lattice from 2012 Table S2 row 4 atomic volume converted to a cubic cell. Site occupancies are a documented maximal-order approximation enforcing the measured alloy composition, not a published refinement. Si fills 4a and occupies 0.08 of 4b; remaining sites are Fe. Superlattice intensities depend on unknown order and are approximate; measured peak positions/phase identity are the robust diffraction information."
