      "notes": "Original numerical precision is retained. Source zero uncertainties remain zero, blank uncertainties remain blank. No open data license was identified. The CSV contains factual measurements, not the source table image or layout. Sample temperatures already include the source gradient correction and must not be corrected again. D03 cell volumes equal the tabulated atomic molar volume times 16/0.602214076. The phase column is derived from which phase volumes are tabulated; B2_volume_only is not an assertion of a single-phase sample. KBr lattice uncertainties are standard errors across indexed d-spacings; pressure errors propagate marker lattice and temperature uncertainty. The 2012 source also identifies sample lattice errors as standard errors. The 2014 temperature errors combine 100 K analytical uncertainty, differences between the two sample sides and thickness correction; no confidence level is specified."
    }
